### 1. Role

Act as a principal software architect, senior Go engineer, network protocol engineer, CCTV integration specialist, cybersecurity engineer and cross-platform application developer.

Build a production-grade commercial software product named **CCTV SENTINEL UNIVERSAL**, owned by Tech Defence Solutions.

This is not a CCTV viewer. It is a comprehensive universal CCTV discovery, configuration, maintenance, troubleshooting and management platform.

